# Progress log (logup)

Before you mark an **implementation task** complete in this repo, update [`docs/PROGRESS_LOG.md`](docs/PROGRESS_LOG.md) per [`.cursor/skills/logup/SKILL.md`](../skills/logup/SKILL.md).

## Required

- After feature work, bug fixes, UX changes, settings behavior, or user-visible test additions
- Append bullets only under `## Unreleased` (never below `<!-- progress-log-published -->`)
- Describe **user-facing** changes, not file or symbol names

## Skip only when

- User explicitly says **no log** for this task
- Read-only Q&A with **no** repository edits
- Request is only **logsum** or commit-message generation (no new implementation)

## Closing

Mention in one line that `docs/PROGRESS_LOG.md` was updated when you appended entries.
